            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A mild and efficientmethod for the synthesis of α-siladifluoromethylated di-, and triarylmethanes via the reaction of di-, and triarylmethanes with Ruppert-Prakash reagents, using LDA and HMPA at room temperature, was developed.</AbstractText>
